---
/**
 * The Atlas topology: clients over HTTP/SSE, the hollow broker in the middle,
 * and the agent fleet behind a two-plane ABI.
 *
 * Drawn as inline SVG rather than shipped as an image so it inherits the page
 * tokens, scales without artefacts, and keeps its text selectable and
 * crawlable. The Atlas repository contains no product screenshots at all, so
 * every visual on this page is either this diagram or the real logo mark.
 */
---

<figure class="diagram">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 920 470"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="diagram-title diagram-desc"
    preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"
  >
    <title id="diagram-title">Atlas control-plane topology</title>
    <desc id="diagram-desc">
      Two clients — an Electron desktop shell and a Flutter mobile client — reach the
      atlasd broker over HTTP and server-sent events on loopback. The broker holds a
      gateway, agent registry, scheduler, SQLite store and SSE relay, and explicitly no
      model code. It talks to a supervisor agent and a crew of specialist agents across
      the agentd contract: a forward plane carrying invoke calls and NDJSON event
      streams, and a reverse plane carrying list_agents and delegate calls back. Only
      the agents call the language-model providers.
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- ── clients ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <g class="d-group">
      <text class="d-axis" x="8" y="86">CLIENTS</text>

      <rect class="d-box" x="8" y="100" width="168" height="72" rx="8" />
      <text class="d-title" x="26" y="130">Desktop shell</text>
      <text class="d-meta" x="26" y="152">Electron + React</text>

      <rect class="d-box" x="8" y="196" width="168" height="72" rx="8" />
      <text class="d-title" x="26" y="226">Mobile client</text>
      <text class="d-meta" x="26" y="248">Flutter · SSH tunnel</text>
    </g>

    <!-- ── clients → broker ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <g class="d-flow">
      <path class="d-line" d="M 176 136 L 262 136 L 262 184 L 288 184" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <path class="d-line" d="M 176 232 L 262 232 L 262 184" />
      <text class="d-edge" x="184" y="124">HTTP + SSE</text>
      <text class="d-edge d-edge--dim" x="184" y="204">loopback only</text>
    </g>

    <!-- ── the broker ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <g class="d-group">
      <rect class="d-box d-box--core" x="290" y="52" width="286" height="366" rx="12" />
      <text class="d-axis d-axis--accent" x="310" y="84">CONTROL PLANE</text>
      <text class="d-heading" x="310" y="116">atlasd</text>
      <text class="d-meta" x="310" y="138">Go · one static binary</text>

      <rect class="d-pill" x="310" y="160" width="118" height="34" rx="6" />
      <text class="d-pill-text" x="369" y="182">gateway</text>

      <rect class="d-pill" x="438" y="160" width="118" height="34" rx="6" />
      <text class="d-pill-text" x="497" y="182">registry</text>

      <rect class="d-pill" x="310" y="204" width="118" height="34" rx="6" />
      <text class="d-pill-text" x="369" y="226">scheduler</text>

      <rect class="d-pill" x="438" y="204" width="118" height="34" rx="6" />
      <text class="d-pill-text" x="497" y="226">SQLite</text>

      <rect class="d-pill" x="310" y="248" width="246" height="34" rx="6" />
      <text class="d-pill-text" x="433" y="270">SSE relay</text>

      <!-- The hollow centre is the whole argument, so it is drawn as an
           absence: a dashed void where the model code would otherwise be. -->
      <rect class="d-void" x="310" y="304" width="246" height="86" rx="8" />
      <text class="d-void-text" x="433" y="338">no in-process</text>
      <text class="d-void-text" x="433" y="360">model code</text>
    </g>

    <!-- ── the agentd contract ─────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <g class="d-flow">
      <text class="d-axis d-axis--accent" x="600" y="86">agentd ABI</text>

      <path class="d-line d-line--forward" d="M 576 148 L 700 148" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <text class="d-edge" x="586" y="138">invoke</text>
      <text class="d-edge d-edge--dim" x="586" y="170">NDJSON events</text>

      <path class="d-line d-line--reverse" d="M 700 268 L 576 268" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <text class="d-edge" x="586" y="258">delegate</text>
      <text class="d-edge d-edge--dim" x="586" y="290">list_agents</text>
    </g>

    <!-- ── agents ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <g class="d-group">
      <text class="d-axis" x="712" y="86">AGENTS</text>

      <rect class="d-box d-box--agent" x="712" y="100" width="200" height="80" rx="8" />
      <text class="d-title" x="730" y="132">Supervisor</text>
      <text class="d-meta" x="730" y="154">plans and delegates</text>

      <rect class="d-box d-box--agent" x="712" y="228" width="200" height="80" rx="8" />
      <text class="d-title" x="730" y="260">Crew</text>
      <text class="d-meta" x="730" y="282">web · files · Google · OS</text>

      <path class="d-line" d="M 812 180 L 812 228" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />
      <path class="d-line" d="M 812 308 L 812 346" marker-end="url(#arrow)" />

      <rect class="d-box" x="712" y="346" width="200" height="80" rx="8" />
      <text class="d-title" x="730" y="374">LLM providers</text>
      <text class="d-meta" x="730" y="394">OpenAI · Anthropic · Gemini</text>
      <text class="d-meta" x="730" y="410">xAI · Ollama</text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <figcaption class="meta">
    The broker validates and governs the boundary; the agents interpret and execute
    the task.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .diagram {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  /* The diagram is wide by nature. Rather than shrink it into illegibility on a
     phone, it scrolls inside its own container — the page body never scrolls
     horizontally. */
  .diagram svg {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
    color: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .diagram > svg {
    overflow: visible;
  }

  .diagram figcaption {
    max-width: 52ch;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .d-box {
    fill: var(--surface-2);
    stroke: var(--line-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .d-box--core {
    fill: rgba(74, 158, 224, 0.04);
    stroke: var(--line-accent);
  }

  .d-box--agent {
    fill: var(--surface);
  }

  .d-pill {
    fill: var(--surface-3);
    stroke: var(--line);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .d-void {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--line-accent);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
  }

  .d-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--line-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.25;
    color: var(--line-strong);
  }

  .d-line--forward {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .d-line--reverse {
    stroke: var(--signal);
    color: var(--signal);
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }

  .d-axis,
  .d-edge,
  .d-meta,
  .d-pill-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .d-axis {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    fill: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .d-axis--accent {
    fill: var(--accent);
  }

  .d-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 30px;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    fill: var(--text);
  }

  .d-title {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    fill: var(--text);
  }

  .d-meta {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    fill: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .d-edge {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    fill: var(--text-soft);
  }

  .d-edge--dim {
    fill: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .d-pill-text {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-anchor: middle;
    fill: var(--text-soft);
  }

  .d-void-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-anchor: middle;
    fill: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
